   "en": "Soshite Hero to Uso wo Tsuku"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "そしてヒーローと噓を吐く"
   },
   {
    "en": "And Lie with Heroes."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Defeated by the heroes, the monster Lurio is not left to a cold death, but is reborn as a young girl in a rehabilitation facility!\nDistrustful at first, Lurio gradually warms up to her caretaker, Yukihito. However, the rehabilitation facility has its own agenda…\n\n(Source: ComicWalker, translated)",
   "ja": "ヒーローに敗北した悪の怪人・ルリオ。 少女の行く末は、冷たい死――ではなく、更生施設だった!!  不信感を露わにするルリオだが、次第に担当職員・ユキヒトに暖かく心を溶かされていく。 しかし、更生施設にはとある思惑があって……"
  },
